# MOD base images published to ghcr.io/modtim with each Community Edition release.
#
# One line per image:   <variant dir>   <image>:<tag>   <platforms>   <tier>
#
#   platforms  multi = linux/amd64 + linux/arm64, amd64 = linux/amd64 only
#              (the accelerator bases have no arm64 variant; same split as
#              MULTIARCH in build-and-push.sh)
#   tier       cpu   = small CPU bases (a few hundred MB each)
#              accel = GPU/NPU bases (multi-GB; build on a runner with lots of disk)
#
# This file is the single list that open-core/build_node_images.sh
# (--base-images) and open-core/publish_ce_release.py read. The published ref is
# <registry>/<namespace>/<image>:<tag>, e.g. ghcr.io/modtim/base-python:3.11, and
# those are the refs the node builder's generated Dockerfiles `FROM`. Each base is
# a pinned upstream vendor image plus security updates and a non-root `mod` user;
# no MOD-proprietary content. Keep it in sync with the VARIANTS map in
# build-and-push.sh (open-core/tests/test_ce_base_images_published.py checks it).
#
# Bases are published under their own version tag (the tag IS the interface), not
# the release tag, and are rebuilt in place when upstream security updates land.
python-3.11             base-python:3.11              multi   cpu
python-3.12             base-python:3.12              multi   cpu
node-20                 base-node:20                  multi   cpu
node-22                 base-node:22                  multi   cpu
go-1.22                 base-go:1.22                  multi   cpu
rust-1.78               base-rust:1.78                multi   cpu
java-21                 base-java:21                  multi   cpu
alpine-3.19             base-alpine:3.19              multi   cpu
distroless-python-3.11  base-distroless-python:3.11   multi   cpu
distroless-node-20      base-distroless-node:20       multi   cpu
cuda-12.4-python3.11    base-cuda:12.4-python3.11     amd64   accel
rocm-6.1-python3.11     base-rocm:6.1-python3.11      amd64   accel
intel-xpu-2025.0        base-intel-xpu:2025.0         amd64   accel
npu-openvino-2025       base-npu:openvino-2025        amd64   accel
